From 668be8ed7bdaf8d8946e3ef706a362fb1bf4f102 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 01:31:31 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Documentation of the corrections of the views

- views.md: getPoints, preconditions of the functions building views,
  outputs which must not overlap, use of views in device code,
  conversions of the views of mgis::function, lifetime of the behaviour
  of a view and of a workspace, mass density and tangent operator blocks
  of a failing point, header of the workspace, error handling, order of
  the parameters, preconditions of the end of a time step.
- generic-parallel.md: mass density required for the speed of sound.
- release notes: allocations, bug fixes.
- Integrate.hxx: the inputs and the outputs given to the material data
  managers follow their layout.
---
