 docs/web/release-notes-3.2.md        | 18 ++++++-
 docs/web/views.md                    | 77 +++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 include/MGIS/Behaviour/Integrate.hxx | 33 ++++++++----
 4 files changed, 106 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

