+default. The static function `FieldView::checkPreconditions` checks the
+preconditions of the constructor beforehand. The functions building views
+have their own preconditions (exact number of values for
+`makeFieldView`, strides not lower than the number of components or of
+points, valid ranges of components and of points), given by their
