+The workspace (`MGIS/Behaviour/BehaviourIntegrationWorkSpace.hxx`,
+included by `MGIS/Behaviour/Integrate.hxx`) keeps a pointer to the
+behaviour for which it has been built: it must be used with views of this
+behaviour (the same object, not a copy), which must outlive it.
