+The functions which return an `MGIS` result throw an exception on invalid
+arguments, as the functions of the material data managers. The setters
+and `updateValues` also have a form taking an execution context
+(`mgis::Context`), as for the material data managers.
+
+The views reproduce the order of the parameters of the existing
+functions: the execution policy comes first, before the output, for the
+rotations and `evaluate`, and after the output for the post-processings
+(`executePostProcessing(outputs, policy, v, name)`).
+
